      "content": "the diagnostic tools just show more and more fatal errors. it’s like the core architecture is fundamentally broken. i've spent so much time trying to debug my life but it's just a loop of the same glitches. at some point, you gotta admit that when the system is this unstable, trying to keep it running is just wasting resources. it's just exhausting to stay powered on when everything is crashing anyway.",
